lucide 0.563.0 (ISC)
https://lucide.dev  |  https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide

Lucide.ttf is the official Lucide icon font, copied verbatim so the shell
carries its own icons instead of depending on a system font install.
Regenerate with:

  nix build nixpkgs#lucide
  cp "$(nix eval --raw --impure --expr \
    '(builtins.getFlake "github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-unstable").legacyPackages.x86_64-linux.lucide.outPath')/share/fonts/truetype/Lucide.ttf" assets/Lucide.ttf

The font maps ligature names ("wifi", "battery-full") to glyphs, so icon
fields hold the plain ASCII name and render through a Text element.
